<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Recorded surfer and drone GPS</name><description>Logged points within the requested window. Green: accepted surfer packets; orange: other/rejected surfer packets; blue: drone-position snapshots. Repeated snapshots are retained, not new independent GPS fixes. Click a point for timestamp, GPS age if logged, source and original record. Times are observation/receipt times. Ground-clamped display, not flight altitude. Short arrows show bearing from the previous logged coordinate of the same subject, not aircraft heading or an observed path. Arrow length is display-only. No arrow for unchanged positions or the first point. A gap label identifies intervals over 1.5s. No connecting tracks or saved targets used as GPS observations.</description><Style id="surfer"><IconStyle><color>ff00cc00</color><scale>0.65</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff00cc00</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style><Folder><name>Surfer — accepted packets</name><Placemark><name>surfer 0</name><styleUrl>#surfer</styleUrl><description>Logged time: 0
Source: test:1
{
  "event": "lora_packet",
  "accepted": true,
  "latitude": 0,
  "longitude": 0
}</description><ExtendedData><Data name="loggedTimestamp"><value>0</value></Data><Data name="sourceFile"><value>test</value></Data><Data name="sourceLine"><value>1</value></Data><Data name="latitude"><value>0</value></Data><Data name="longitude"><value>0</value></Data><Data name="travelDirectionStatus"><value>First coordinate in window</value></Data><Data name="event"><value>lora_packet</value></Data><Data name="accepted"><value>True</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>0,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>surfer 1</name><styleUrl>#surfer</styleUrl><description>Logged time: 1
Source: test:2
{
  "event": "lora_packet",
  "accepted": true,
  "latitude": 0,
  "longitude": 0
}</description><ExtendedData><Data name="loggedTimestamp"><value>1</value></Data><Data name="sourceFile"><value>test</value></Data><Data name="sourceLine"><value>2</value></Data><Data name="latitude"><value>0</value></Data><Data name="longitude"><value>0</value></Data><Data name="travelDirectionStatus"><value>Unchanged reported coordinate; no direction arrow</value></Data><Data name="event"><value>lora_packet</value></Data><Data name="accepted"><value>True</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>0,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>surfer 2</name><styleUrl>#surfer</styleUrl><description>Logged time: 2
Source: test:3
{
  "event": "lora_packet",
  "accepted": true,
