Source: test:3</description><MultiGeometry><LineString><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>0.001,0 0.0010269796481736648,1.652026989138585e-21</coordinates></LineString><LineString><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>0.0010188018769383689,-4.721438431073322e-06 0.0010269796481736648,1.652026989138585e-21 0.0010188018769383689,4.721438431073321e-06</coordinates></LineString></MultiGeometry></Placemark></Folder></Document></kml>